This license covers the files in this repository ("the Runtime"): a patch to llama.cpp, build scripts and documentation
that let llama.cpp load and execute Opti model files. Opti is a compression method that is the subject of U.S. Provisional
Patent Application No. 64/154,967, filed September 15, 2026 ("the Method"). PATENT PENDING.

